      "strengths_deep_dive": [
        "Emgage Foundation demonstrates a high level of fiscal discipline, evidenced by its <cite id=\"7\">fundraising efficiency of $0.02 per $1 raised</cite>. This allows the organization to maximize the impact of its <cite id=\"3\">$4.9 million in FY2023 revenue</cite>. Their leadership is also highly rated, receiving a <cite id=\"12\">perfect 100 score for Leadership from Charity Navigator</cite>. Beyond its own programs, the foundation strengthens the civic ecosystem by providing <cite id=\"9\">$920,000 in grants</cite> to partners like <cite id=\"13\">OCA-Greater Houston and Every Voice TX</cite>."
      ],
      "summary": "Emgage Foundation is a national, non-partisan organization dedicated to mobilizing Muslim American voters and advocating for policies that empower their communities. The organization operates a variety of civic engagement initiatives, including the <cite id=\"1\">Million Muslim Votes Campaign</cite> and <cite id=\"2\">Get Out The Vote (GOTV) programming</cite>. In FY2024, the foundation reported <cite id=\"3\">total revenue of $4,069,674</cite>, representing a <cite id=\"4\">17% decline from the previous year</cite>. Despite this recent dip in funding, the organization maintains a <cite id=\"5\">97/100 overall score from Charity Navigator</cite>, reflecting high standards of accountability. Their operations are notably efficient, with a <cite id=\"6\">program expense ratio of 93.3%</cite> in FY2023 and a <cite id=\"7\">fundraising efficiency of $0.02 per $1 raised</cite>. This lean financial model ensures that nearly every dollar donated directly supports their mission of <cite id=\"8\">increasing Muslim American civic participation</cite> through voter registration and leadership training. The foundation also acts as a significant grantmaker, distributing <cite id=\"9\">$920,000 in domestic grants</cite> to 33 recipients to support broader civic infrastructure. While the organization has a long track record, its focus on systemic change and advocacy represents a specific niche within the charitable sector.",
